# Rules for editing this file
#
# 1. Every URL must exist and return HTTP 200. Verify before publishing.
# 2. Descriptions must match what the page actually contains.
# 3. Exclude admin, login, account, cart, checkout, search results, tag and
#    author archives, feeds, pagination, assets, and URLs with query parameters.
# 4. Curate, do not enumerate. This is not a copy of the sitemap.
# 5. Delete every section that does not apply rather than leaving placeholders.
